select a,max(b) from ${testName2}_substringTbl group by a;
rows:
 (null,'the development team will work on issues from the Backlog and issues will end up in one of the 3 green states')
 ('0B0101',null)
 ('A','I do agree with you that our Jira workflow is very simplistic and needs to be matured')
 ('A01','You are right that the current workflow does not give the test team the flexibility and responsibilities that you need.')
 ('A0101','So let’s fix it together')
 ('A0102','We want to mature SE as a product and to get there we also need to mature our processes')
 ('A02','so I think this is a good time to make some of these changes')
 ('A0201','The existing workflow was very simple in part because I needed to get everyone on the development team using it')
 ('A0202','Some are harder to encourage than others')
 ('B','The workflow also needs to cater for managing the development of new features')
 ('B01','so it’s important that we get the balance right that works for both teams.')
 ('B0102','n thinking about this')
 ('B02','I have drawn out the existing workflow and then drawn a possible new workflow that we could move to')
 ('B0201','Please refer to the attached document (either in PDF or in Keynote format)')
 ('B0202','The new workflow gives the test team better visibility of issues that need to be actioned as well as the responsibility for validating fixes and acknowledging/closing bugs')

